%% Lab 10: one tool-using turn and the four numbers the lab measures.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab10_one_turn.mmd -o lab10_one_turn.png -b white -s 2
sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Rep's screen
    participant A as Copilot
    participant M as Chat model
    participant T as Tools (Ops API)
    R->>A: question, clock starts
    A->>M: model call 1
    M-->>A: start of a tool call
    Note over R,A: first chunk: no words yet
    A->>T: find_customer
    T-->>A: JSON result
    A->>M: model call 2
    M-->>A: tool call
    A->>T: get_customer_invoices
    T-->>A: JSON result
    A->>M: model call 3
    M-->>R: first words of the reply
    Note over R,A: first text:<br/>the rep's time<br/>to first token
    M-->>R: ... last words
    Note over R,A: total time =<br/>model time + tool<br/>time + overhead
